WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.965
Need a hand setting up Castvoo?

2
00:00:06.095 --> 00:00:11.406
Invite a setup helper, like your media buyer or a friend, to set things up for you.

3
00:00:11.536 --> 00:00:13.391
No password sharing.

4
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.822
Open Settings, then Team.

5
00:00:15.952 --> 00:00:21.193
One helper is free on every plan, even Free, and it doesn't use a team seat.

6
00:00:21.493 --> 00:00:23.737
Tap Invite a setup helper.

7
00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:27.935
Invite them by email, and only that email can accept.

8
00:00:28.235 --> 00:00:33.076
Or create a one-time invite link, and share it on Telegram or WhatsApp.

9
00:00:33.377 --> 00:00:37.541
Your helper opens it, and logs in with their own Castvoo account.

10
00:00:37.841 --> 00:00:40.170
First, they see what they can do.

11
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.374
Bots, channels, Welcome Flows, follow-ups and broadcasts.

12
00:00:44.674 --> 00:00:46.331
And what they can't.

13
00:00:46.461 --> 00:00:51.089
Your login, deleting the account, your earnings, or inviting anyone else.

14
00:00:51.389 --> 00:00:54.614
They tap Accept, and they're in, as your helper.

15
00:00:55.089 --> 00:00:59.045
Back in your Settings, you see your helper, and everything they change.

16
00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:04.047
Turn off Can send broadcasts, and their messages wait for your approval.

17
00:01:04.177 --> 00:01:07.408
Billing and plan stays off, unless you allow it.

18
00:01:07.707 --> 00:01:11.743
Remove your helper any time, and their access ends instantly.

19
00:01:12.045 --> 00:01:14.934
One setup helper is free on every plan.

20
00:01:15.064 --> 00:01:18.588
Get set up faster, and keep your password to yourself.
